 gliner, gliner-classify, gliner-pii and gliner-guardrails run GLiNER2
 boundary-architecture checkpoints (entity extraction, zero-shot
 classification, PII detection/redaction and LLM guardrails) locally via
 candle, downloading checkpoints from Hugging Face on first use.
